<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NatMut half year net A$175.52 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NatMut half year net A$175.52 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 230.64 vs  194.72</p>
<p>    Net				  175.52 vs  148.31</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   4.0  vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: National Mutual Holdings Ltd is a life insurance group, 51 percent owned by French insurance group AXA. It listed its shares in Australia and New Zealand in October last year and had not paid an interim dividend before.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  749.97 vs 671.83</p>
<p>    Other income			  30.21 vs  14.89</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   10.0  vs   9.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date August 29</p>
<p>Reg date August 1</p>
<p>    Tax					2.76 vs   1.70</p>
<p>    Interest				98.17 vs  37.18</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   5.73 vs   4.21</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
